 return `<h3>SSH installation</h3><p>Target: <span class="mono">${esc(transaction.ssh_target||'No target recorded for this invitation')}</span></p><p>Execution: <strong data-ssh-state>${esc(observation.state)}</strong></p>${observation.error_code?`<p class="note" role="status">${esc(sshReason(observation.error_code))}${observation.exit_code?` · exit ${esc(observation.exit_code)}`:''}</p>`:''}${observation.state==='running'?'<p>The control is checking and installing on the target. You can close this page; execution continues.</p>':observation.state==='succeeded'?'<p>The installer and target identity were read back. Device authorization and runtime reports are shown separately.</p>':'<p>An absent execution result does not prove failure. Continuing first checks the target and preserves this invitation and its device identity.</p>'}${observation.inspection?'<h4>Last target inspection</h4>'+sshInspectionHTML(observation.inspection):''}${action}`;
